<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Personal Introduction</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 60%;
            margin: auto;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #3498db;
        }

        .profile-img {
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 4px solid #3498db;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555;
        }

        ul {
            list-style-type: square;
            text-align: left;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        li {
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Vijay T</h1>

        <img src="profile.jpg" alt="My Photo" class="profile-img">

        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
            Hello! My name is Vijay. I am currently pursuing MCA at
            Rathinam Technical Campus. I am interested in Cloud Computing,
            Python Programming, and Web Development. I enjoy learning new
            technologies and improving my technical skills.
        </p>

        <h2>My Hobbies</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Listening to Music</li>
            <li>Playing Games</li>
            <li>Learning New Technologies</li>
            <li>Watching Tech Videos</li>
            <li>Practicing English</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
